------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Study, assay, factor and sample metadata are derived from the NASA Open
Science Data Repository (OSDR / GeneLab, https://osdr.nasa.gov). NASA OSDR
data are released under the NASA Open Data policy. Please cite the individual
OSD accessions (see data/registry/study_registry.csv and manuscript
references) when reusing the integrated data.
